@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title Human vs AI — Round Flow

actor Human
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as FE
participant "Controller\n(Flask API)" as API
participant "GameManager" as GM
participant "AI Model\n(GRU)" as AI
database "SessionStore\n(Disk)" as Store

== New Game ==
Human -> FE: Click "vs AI" → select "rnn_v1.1"
FE -> API: POST /api/games\n{mode: "pve", ai: "rnn_v1.1"}
API -> API: Validate AI name in registry
API -> GM: new GameManager(mode="pve")
API -> GM: start_game()
API -> API: ai_state = [0.0]*8
note right: Hardcoded zeros:\ninit_hidden_state() is trivial\nand model not loaded yet
API -> Store: save(game_id, gm, ai_state=ai_state)
API --> FE: 201 {game_id, state}
FE -> FE: Show game board (human's hand + AI card backs)

== Round N ==
Human -> FE: Select card (e.g. "attack")
FE -> API: POST /api/games/{id}/play\n{cards_1: ["attack"]}

API -> Store: load(game_id)
Store --> API: gm, ai_state
API -> AI: select_action(state, ai_state)

activate AI
AI -> AI: Build 14-d input vector\n(card counts, HP, one-hot history)
AI -> AI: GRU forward → policy logits
AI -> AI: Mask illegal cards → softmax → argmax
AI --> API: ("defense", new_hidden_state)
deactivate AI

API -> API: str_to_card("defense") → CardType.DEFENSE
API -> GM: play_round([ATTACK], [DEFENSE])
activate GM
GM -> GM: Resolve: Attack vs Defense
GM -> GM: Apply damage, discard cards, check end
GM --> API: RoundResult
deactivate GM

API -> Store: save(game_id, gm, new_hidden_state)
API --> FE: 200 {round_result, state}

FE -> FE: Show reveal:\nYou: Attack vs AI: Defense\nDamage + HP + winner banner

@enduml
